{
  "label": "Disposition",
  "description": "Every deliverable into exactly one of shipped / cut / reduced (feature.md §8 step 5). A reduced deliverable whose product doc still describes the original is the single most common way this tree starts lying.",
  "inputs": {
    "features": {
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id",
            "story",
            "importance",
            "metrics"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "story": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "As a [who], I should be able to [what] so that I can [value]."
            },
            "importance": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 1
            },
            "metrics": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "requires": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "findings": {
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    "tests": {
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "disposition": {
      "kind": "json",
      "binding": {
        "op": {
          "kind": "function",
          "functionRef": "op.member",
          "input": {
            "value": {
              "kind": "json",
              "binding": {
                "op": {
                  "kind": "function",
                  "functionRef": "op.member",
                  "input": {
                    "value": {
                      "kind": "json",
                      "binding": {
                        "op": {
                          "kind": "function",
                          "functionRef": "context.get",
                          "input": {
                            "name": {
                              "kind": "text",
                              "binding": {
                                "text": "operation"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "output": {
                            "name": "value",
                            "kind": "json"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "prop": {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "binding": {
                        "text": "output"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "output": {
                    "name": "value",
                    "kind": "json"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "prop": {
              "kind": "text",
              "binding": {
                "text": "disposition"
              }
            }
          },
          "output": {
            "name": "value",
            "kind": "json"
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "disposition"
    },
    "shipped": {
      "kind": "json",
      "binding": {
        "op": {
          "kind": "function",
          "functionRef": "op.member",
          "input": {
            "value": {
              "kind": "json",
              "binding": {
                "op": {
                  "kind": "function",
                  "functionRef": "op.member",
                  "input": {
                    "value": {
                      "kind": "json",
                      "binding": {
                        "op": {
                          "kind": "function",
                          "functionRef": "context.get",
                          "input": {
                            "name": {
                              "kind": "text",
                              "binding": {
                                "text": "operation"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "output": {
                            "name": "value",
                            "kind": "json"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "prop": {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "binding": {
                        "text": "output"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "output": {
                    "name": "value",
                    "kind": "json"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "prop": {
              "kind": "text",
              "binding": {
                "text": "shipped"
              }
            }
          },
          "output": {
            "name": "value",
            "kind": "json"
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "shipped"
    }
  },
  "operation": {
    "kind": "prompt",
    "user": "Put every deliverable into exactly one of **shipped**, **cut**, or **reduced**.\n\nExactly one. Every deliverable. No deliverable is left undisposed, because an\nundisposed deliverable is one nobody will look for again.\n\n## The deliverables\n\n{{.inputs.features}}\n\n## The findings\n\n{{.inputs.findings}}\n\n## The acceptance tests and what they reported\n\n{{.inputs.tests}}\n\n## The three dispositions\n\n- **shipped** — the person from the story can get the value, and there is a\n  passing acceptance test that would notice if they stopped.\n- **cut** — it is not in this release. Say whether it is deferred or abandoned;\n  those are different facts and only one of them is a follow-up.\n- **reduced** — it shipped as something smaller than the story promised. Say\n  exactly what it now is.\n\n## Read the disposition against phase 6, not against the diff\n\nA deliverable is not shipped because code exists for it. **A deliverable marked\nshipped whose acceptance test asserts an intermediate did not ship.** Check each\none against what the acceptance results actually reported, and against what its\ntest actually asserts — the diff will tell you something was built, which is a\ndifferent claim.\n\n## The reduction trap\n\n**A `reduced` deliverable whose product doc still describes the original is the\nsingle most common way this tree starts lying.** Every reduction you record here\nbecomes an edit the correction pass has to make to `docs/product/<id>.md`. Write\nthe reduction so that edit is obvious: what the story said, what shipped, and\nwhat the story should now say.\n\n## What to produce\n\n`disposition` — one row per deliverable: the `id`, one of\n`shipped` / `cut` / `reduced`, the evidence, and — for `reduced` — what it now is\nand what the product doc must be changed to say.\n\n`shipped` — just the ids disposed as shipped. This is the workflow's `features`\noutput, so it is the answer to \"what did this run ship\".\n",
    "config": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5"
    },
    "input": {},
    "output": {
      "name": "output",
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "disposition": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "shipped": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "disposition",
          "shipped"
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
